From u3fe90052fbf2f899 at groups.google.com  Sat Apr 26 20:19:59 2014
From: u3fe90052fbf2f899 at groups.google.com (Terrence Jorgensen)
Date: Sat, 26 Apr 2014 20:19:59 +0000
Subject: Re: full covariance matrix in lavaan
Message-ID: <PVhk479wXUs.Zaix0jrWrsEJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <PVhk479wXUs.Vn_DculxTMEJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
References: <PVhk479wXUs.Vn_DculxTMEJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
