I don't think your model is identified.  Try removing the covariances between first-order factors (F1, F2, and F3).  Their correlations are supposed to be reproduced by the higher-order factor.

model<- 'F1=~v1+v2+v3
               F2 =~v4+v7+v8
               F3=~v5+v6+v9

               F4=~F1+F2+F3'

Terry

