Hello Again,

You have no latent variables in your path diagram, so the latent variable section should be removed.

Then you need to add that regression to your model.

This will do it:

mod1 <- '

# regressions
congressAtt ~ perceptions
rollCallBehav ~ perceptions + congressAtt

perceptions ~ consAtt
'

Jeremy

